# 3. MARKETPLACE TEAM PURPOSE

The Marketplace AI Team provides intelligence for the Freelancify marketplace itself.

Its responsibilities include:

* project discovery intelligence
* marketplace matching
* project quality analysis
* pricing/budget intelligence
* marketplace trend/insight analysis
* opportunity analysis
* marketplace-level recommendations

It should serve both:

* freelancer-side marketplace discovery
* client-side marketplace/project intelligence

while remaining separate from the Client AI Team and Freelancer AI Team.

